[0.044511, "o", "\r\n❯ 🧱  Infrastructure\r\n      hook binary         ✓ ok\r\n      daemon binary       ✓ ok\r\n      policy.yaml         ✓ ok\r\n      systemd unit        ✓ ok\r\n      daemon              ✓ running\r\n      secrets broker      ✓ listening\r\n\r\n❯ 🔌  Agent hooks\r\n      Claude Code         ✓ detected (~/.claude exists)  ✓ installed\r\n      Cursor              ✗ not detected  ✗ not installed\r\n      Codex               ✗ not detected  ✗ not installed\r\n        note: hooks.json not found or unreadable\r\n        note: config.toml not found (features.hooks unknown)\r\n        note: grant trust once in Codex: run /hooks (agentjail can't read Codex trust state)\r\n"]
